    "start_seconds": 203.8,
    "end_seconds": 205.43,
    "text": "dead. And some of y'all fall for it. \"Well, my"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:25.430",
    "end": "00:03:25.440",
    "start_seconds": 205.43,
    "end_seconds": 205.44,
    "text": "And some of y'all fall for it. \"Well, my"
