    "start": "00:03:25.440",
    "end": "00:03:27.509",
    "start_seconds": 205.44,
    "end_seconds": 207.50900000000001,
    "text": "And some of y'all fall for it. \"Well, my mama, she got you.\" Yeah, that what they"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:27.509",
    "end": "00:03:27.519",
    "start_seconds": 207.50900000000001,
    "end_seconds": 207.519,
    "text": "mama, she got you.\" Yeah, that what they"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:27.519",
    "end": "00:03:29.870",
    "start_seconds": 207.519,
    "end_seconds": 209.87,
    "text": "mama, she got you.\" Yeah, that what they trying to do. So, in there was a casket"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:29.870",
    "end": "00:03:29.880",
    "start_seconds": 209.87,
    "end_seconds": 209.88,
    "text": "trying to do. So, in there was a casket"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:29.880",
    "end": "00:03:36.830",
    "start_seconds": 209.88,
    "end_seconds": 216.82999999999998,
    "text": "trying to do. So, in there was a casket room with a little eerie music."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:36.840",
    "end": "00:03:38.949",
    "start_seconds": 216.84,
    "end_seconds": 218.949,
    "text": "Inside the casket room was sample"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:38.949",
    "end": "00:03:38.959",
    "start_seconds": 218.949,
    "end_seconds": 218.959,
    "text": "Inside the casket room was sample"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:38.959",
    "end": "00:03:41.790",
    "start_seconds": 218.959,
    "end_seconds": 221.79,
    "text": "Inside the casket room was sample caskets that hang out the wall."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:41.790",
    "end": "00:03:41.800",
    "start_seconds": 221.79,
    "end_seconds": 221.8,
    "text": "caskets that hang out the wall."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:41.800",
    "end": "00:03:44.657",
    "start_seconds": 221.8,
    "end_seconds": 224.65699999999998,
    "text": "caskets that hang out the wall. You got cardboard,"
