    "start_seconds": 276.67,
    "end_seconds": 276.68,
    "text": "would want to rest eternally in.\""
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:36.680",
    "end": "00:04:39.590",
    "start_seconds": 276.68,
    "end_seconds": 279.59000000000003,
    "text": "would want to rest eternally in.\" I said, \"No."
