    "start": "00:04:39.590",
    "end": "00:04:39.600",
    "start_seconds": 279.59000000000003,
    "end_seconds": 279.6,
    "text": "I said, \"No."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:39.600",
    "end": "00:04:41.909",
    "start_seconds": 279.6,
    "end_seconds": 281.909,
    "text": "I said, \"No. You don't know my daddy."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:41.909",
    "end": "00:04:41.919",
    "start_seconds": 281.909,
    "end_seconds": 281.919,
    "text": "You don't know my daddy."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:41.919",
    "end": "00:04:44.590",
    "start_seconds": 281.919,
    "end_seconds": 284.59000000000003,
    "text": "You don't know my daddy. My daddy was a pastor, and he would"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:44.590",
    "end": "00:04:44.600",
    "start_seconds": 284.59000000000003,
    "end_seconds": 284.6,
    "text": "My daddy was a pastor, and he would"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:44.600",
    "end": "00:04:49.070",
    "start_seconds": 284.6,
    "end_seconds": 289.07,
    "text": "My daddy was a pastor, and he would rather have Jesus than silver,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:49.070",
    "end": "00:04:49.080",
    "start_seconds": 289.07,
    "end_seconds": 289.08,
    "text": "rather have Jesus than silver,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:49.080",
    "end": "00:04:51.830",
    "start_seconds": 289.08,
    "end_seconds": 291.83,
    "text": "rather have Jesus than silver, a Marcus D. Wiley, man. I appreciate"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:51.830",
    "end": "00:04:51.840",
    "start_seconds": 291.83,
    "end_seconds": 291.84000000000003,
    "text": "a Marcus D. Wiley, man. I appreciate"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:51.840",
    "end": "00:04:52.870",
    "start_seconds": 291.84000000000003,
    "end_seconds": 292.87,
    "text": "a Marcus D. Wiley, man. I appreciate y'all."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:52.870",
    "end": "00:04:52.880",
    "start_seconds": 292.87,
    "end_seconds": 292.88,
    "text": "y'all."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:52.880",
    "end": "00:04:55.440",
    "start_seconds": 292.88,
    "end_seconds": 295.44,
    "text": "y'all. Thank you."
  }
]
